Root cause:
The bug was caused by the configuration system not properly handling multiple references to the same variable within a single expression, leading to potential self-referential loops that could result in infinite recursion during variable substitution. The original substitution logic failed to detect such cycles effectively, which could yield incorrect or unexpected results.

